{"id":"n28562-4-8","stage":2,"title":"넘기다 · 翻","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28562-4-8-1","ko":"이 페이지를 보면 되나요?","zh":"看这一页就可以了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"페이지를","meaning":"页","explanation":"페이지：页；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"페이지","audio":"/audio/6c84a1b3b066b74c6479.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81961","senseId":"1","lemma":"페이지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"페이지를","audio":"/audio/d587a3b0ed07c89bb10a.mp3"}},{"text":"보면","meaning":"阅读，看","explanation":"보다：阅读，看；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"3","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보면","audio":"/audio/35629c9db8f201235337.mp3"}},{"text":"되나요?","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되나요","audio":"/audio/7ee6d2f020195c6ebb22.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"6c84a1b3b066b74c","term":"페이지","zh":"页","audio":"/audio/6c84a1b3b066b74c6479.mp3","entryId":"81961","definition":"书籍、报纸、文件等的一面。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"阅读，看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"读书籍、报纸、地图中的字、图、符号等而理解内容。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","z